        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    title Normal read: view current rates\n    actor U as User\n    participant M as Mobile app\n    participant C as Local cache\n    participant S as Web service\n    participant D as SQLite database\n    participant N as NBP API (external)\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;M: Open rates screen\n    M-&gt;&gt;C: Read cached rates\n    C--&gt;&gt;M: Cached rates + timestamp\n    M--&gt;&gt;U: Show cached rates with \&quot;last updated\&quot; time\n    M-&gt;&gt;S: GET /rates (JWT)\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: Verify JWT (authentication)\n    S-&gt;&gt;D: Read latest stored rates\n    D--&gt;&gt;S: Rates + fetchedAt\n    alt Stored rate missing or not from the latest business day\n        S-&gt;&gt;N: HTTPS request (Table C)\n        N--&gt;&gt;S: Bid/ask rates + effectiveDate\n        S-&gt;&gt;D: Store rates + fetchedAt\n    end\n    S--&gt;&gt;M: 200 rates, effectiveDate, fetchedAt\n    M-&gt;&gt;C: Save rates + timestamp\n    M--&gt;&gt;U: Show fresh rates\n\n    Note over M,S: If the request fails or times out, the app retries (max 3 attempts, 1 s, 2 s, 4 s), then keeps the cached rates marked as cached or stale&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="DiHT4UJTs_TfEzkvnhGo-1">
